                "Unresolved": [
                  "UNRESOLVED (p.438): FIB-96 bottom flange corner chamfer - the 3/4\u0022 chamfers at the bottom corners are drawn (vector drawing 0.73\u0022) but not dimensioned. 3/4\u0022 chamfer as drawn.",
                  "UNRESOLVED (p.428-431, p.422-424): girder length \u0027A\u0027 vs bearing-to-bearing \u002B end distances - A is the length along the sloped girder (b-b \u002B end distances x the grade factor: spans 30 and 32 reproduce within 1/16\u0022), but ONE A is printed for spans 31-32 and one for 33-34 although their grades differ (vertical curves), so A cannot hold for both spans of a pair. Beams built from the framing plan: layout CL bearings (bent line \u002B- 1\u0027-2\u0022, 3\u0027-2\u0022 at bent 29, 1\u0027-4\u0022 at bent 35) \u002B the 9\u0022 / 11\u0022 end distances along the beam; the check reports A - model.",
